OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,F"It's burned down. Our neighbours
OL,7,Fhouse it was erased, just like we see
OL,8,Fin Gaza, the whole estate is like
OL,9,Fthat."
OL,11,FUttam Shiralkar was at home in
OL,12,FStourbridge when he started to smell
OL,13,Fsmoke.
OL,15,FBut once he went outside to see what
OL,16,Fwas happening, he wasn't allowed to
OL,17,Freturn.
OL,19,FPolice told him to vacate the
OL,20,Fproperty, leaving everything behind.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
