CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FHe wasn't even allowed to drive away
OL,7,Fin his car.
OL,9,FHe said he hoped it was just his back
OL,10,Fgate that was burning, until he and
OL,11,Fhis wife Sandy saw their home on the
OL,12,Fnews.
OL,14,F"We saw on TV the top room of our
OL,15,Fhouse is actively burning, the garage
OL,16,Fis gone," Uttam said.
OL,18,F"We're still in shock, numb, it still
OL,19,Fhasn't sunk in," he added.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
