SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FSandy said their son cried when they
OL,7,Fcalled to tell him what had happened.
OL,9,FShe said: "It's all my lifetime
OL,10,Fgathering.
OL,12,F"All my son's clothes and books, so
OL,13,Fmuch attachment and all is gone.
OL,15,F"We will rebuild it because that's
OL,16,Fwhat we do, but I feel sad about
OL,17,Flosing all my belongings."
OL,19,FSandy and Uttam lived on Quarry Park
OL,20,FRoad which is now in an exclusion
OL,21,Fzone, as it is structurally unsafe.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
