OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FA hundred firefighters were tackling
OL,7,Fthe blaze last night.
OL,9,FA total of 54 patients have been
OL,10,Ftreated by paramedics ` including 19
OL,11,Fwho were taken to hospital ` as a
OL,12,Fresult of wildfires in the West
OL,13,FMidlands, the region's ambulance
OL,14,Fservice said.
OL,16,F"The devastation is extensive"
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
