OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FChief Fire Officer Simon Tuhill said:
OL,7,F"This has been one of the most
OL,8,Fsignificant incidents that West
OL,9,FMidlands Fire Service has ever
OL,10,Fattended. The devastation is
OL,11,Fextensive."
OL,13,FFourteen fire engines remain at the
OL,14,Ffire today, with crews working across
OL,15,Fseveral areas of the site.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Fire Service say
OL,18,Ffirefighters are extinguishing
OL,19,Fhotspots and monitoring areas at risk
OL,20,Fof re-ignition.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FSpeaking at the scene of the
OL,7,FStourbridge blaze, Mr Tuhill said the
OL,8,Ffire is believed to have started in
OL,9,Fthe grassland, before spreading to
OL,10,Fhomes nearby.
OL,12,FAssistant Chief Fire Officer Richard
OL,13,FStanton said this morning:
OL,15,F"First and foremost, our thoughts are
OL,16,Fwith everyone affected by this fire.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,F"We know a number of families have
OL,7,Fseen their homes destroyed or
OL,8,Fseriously damaged and our thoughts are
OL,9,Fwith everyone that has been affected
OL,10,Fby this incident.
OL,12,F"Our crews have been working
OL,13,Fincredibly hard overnight and into
OL,14,Fthis morning to get things under
OL,15,Fcontrol and the situation is vastly
OL,16,Fimproved from yesterday afternoon, but
OL,17,Fwe'll have resources at the scene for
OL,18,Fsome time yet.
OL,20,F"Please, help us by staying away from
OL,21,Fthe incident ground."
OL,26,@tD@AOU|D@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FNathan Hudson from West Midlands
OL,7,FAmbulance Service said six people were
OL,8,Ftreated by crews at the scene in the
OL,9,Ftown, with two taken to hospital after
OL,10,Fsuffering from smoke inhalation
OL,11,Fyesterday.
OL,13,FDudley Council opened up rest centres
OL,14,Fat the Town Hall and local leisure
OL,15,Fcentre for people who had to evacuate.
OL,17,FCouncillor Ed Lawrence, the member for
OL,18,Femergency planning, estimated 250-300
OL,19,Fpeople went to the town hall.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FHe said: "Our absolute main focus has
OL,7,Fbeen on getting those residents
OL,8,Fsomewhere safe where they can be
OL,9,Flooked after, fed, watered and getting
OL,10,Fthem somewhere safe overnight."
OL,12,FMental health providers, GPs and
OL,13,Fparamedics were also on-site to
OL,14,Fprovide support to residents.
OL,16,FMr Lawrence said a number of care
OL,17,Fhomes had to be evacuated, and a local
OL,18,Fboarding school has allowed the
OL,19,Fcouncil to use their rooms to
OL,20,Ftemporarily house people.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FThe council have set up a hotline for
OL,7,Ffamily members to check if people have
OL,8,Fregistered with them, saying:
OL,10,F"We've had to move residents out of
OL,11,Fcare homes, so if you have got a
OL,12,Ffamily member that you don't know
OL,13,Fwhere they are and they haven't made
OL,14,Fcontact with you, you can call the
OL,15,Fcouncil on 0300 5552040 and they'll be
OL,16,Fable to tell you whether they are in
OL,17,Four care or not."
OL,19,FCat Eccles, MP for Stourbridge was at
OL,20,Fthe town hall to assist with providing
OL,21,Fsupport to residents.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FShe said: "It's really shocking,
OL,7,Freally awful, there's some really
OL,8,Fheartbreaking stories inside there.
OL,10,F"People who have lost everything. It's
OL,11,Freally not what we expected to see in
OL,12,FStourbridge today."
OL,14,FThe Prime Minister has pledged to
OL,15,Fsupport fire and rescue services in
OL,16,Fthe region with any additional
OL,17,Fresources they need.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/13
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
