PN,34712
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786830495
OL,3,C'It still hasn't sunk in': Couple lost
OL,4,Ctheir home in devastating fire
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said: "Awful to see homes
OL,7,Fand communities hit by fires across
OL,8,Fthe country tonight as the heatwave
OL,9,Fcontinues.
OL,11,F"My thoughts are with everyone
OL,12,Faffected, particularly those who have
OL,13,Fbeen injured or forced from their
OL,14,Fhomes, and with the firefighters who
OL,15,Fhave been taken to hospital.
OL,17,F"I'm in touch with local leaders
OL,18,F(including West Midlands Mayor Richard
OL,19,FParker) and will be speaking to
OL,20,Femergency services on the ground as
OL,21,Fthey continue their response."
OL,26,@nD@TOUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G12/13
